# UV Package Manager
RULE: Always use uv. No exceptions — not in Docker, not in CI, not in scripts.
WHY: uv 10-100x faster; consistent tooling everywhere eliminates environment drift.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/dependency-management.md
DO: uv pip install -e .; RUN uv pip install --system -e . in Dockerfile; uv lock; uv sync
NEVER: pip install -e .; pip install ruff; python -m pip install; RUN pip install in Dockerfiles
NEVER: uv pip install -e ".[dev]" or uv sync --extra dev — no optional extras exist (flat deps only)
